comment {Widget Properties dialog for the fldtk Fluid editor -- the panel
shown while editing an ordinary widget on the design canvas (as
opposed to a non-widget project-tree entry like a Function/Class/Decl,
each of which has its own separate, already-converted page in this
same file).
